{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if the things you did never really left? What if the walls remembered\u2014and they wanted you to remember too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse&quot;\u00a0</strong>is a short first-person psychological horror game set in a run-down industrial building in Hong Kong. You\u2019re here for a simple job. But when the elevator grinds to a stop on the wrong floor, you\u2019re trapped somewhere you were never meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the harder it gets to tell what\u2019s real. The building feels alive. The air is heavy. And something\u2014or someone\u2014is always just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/Screenshot2.png?t=1745320765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focused 30\u201345 minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif1.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See the world through a VHS-style lens\u2014glitchy, unstable, and unnerving. Like you\u2019re watching something you shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif3.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jumpscares + Unsettling Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just carefully timed moments, disturbing audio, and details that stick with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif2.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you\u2019ll find a weapon. No, you won\u2019t feel safe. Firing it feels wrong. Every shot brings you closer to something you don\u2019t want to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif4.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656990?t=1745320765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656990?t=1745320765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/b06c3fd7cd0a42ac82e1f1d97236628d0328ab32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745320765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/b06c3fd7cd0a42ac82e1f1d97236628d0328ab32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745320765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if the things you did never really left? What if the walls remembered\u2014and they wanted you to remember too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse&quot;\u00a0</strong>is a short first-person psychological horror game set in a run-down industrial building in Hong Kong. You\u2019re here for a simple job. But when the elevator grinds to a stop on the wrong floor, you\u2019re trapped somewhere you were never meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the harder it gets to tell what\u2019s real. The building feels alive. The air is heavy. And something\u2014or someone\u2014is always just out of sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/Screenshot2.png?t=1745320765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focused 30\u201345 minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif1.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See the world through a VHS-style lens\u2014glitchy, unstable, and unnerving. Like you\u2019re watching something you shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif3.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jumpscares + Unsettling Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just carefully timed moments, disturbing audio, and details that stick with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif2.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you\u2019ll find a weapon. No, you won\u2019t feel safe. Firing it feels wrong. Every shot brings you closer to something you don\u2019t want to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/showcase_gif4.gif?t=1745320765\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Echo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/a9aaecbc11637ee4e0a48e7f0bdf5b7480a6b602/header.jpg?t=1745320765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125814,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125814/movie480.mp4?t=1744787935","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125814/movie_max.mp4?t=1744787935"},"name":"\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125814/10029ebea39f4182a21b14d7f6be08ad268e7115/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744787935","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125814/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744787935","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125814/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744787935"}}],"name":"\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is highly recommended. A minimum of 6GB VRAM and DirectX 12 supported Hardware required.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></l